":"iyn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61b8300c-c11b-4bf1-8c4e-87a9ab0e0d05","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"良さげ","ts":"1624879524.461300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L/hO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8251ea8f-a931-4096-94b9-c0c670adf511","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/Nukesor/pueue/wiki/Get-started\u003e\nデーモンを使う仕様なのでここに書いてある方法で動かす必要があるっぽい","ts":"1624876380.460800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"imp","count":1,"users":["U06ECBRTJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PHxFs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a04b29b5-b62d-4235-8d08-c8e7ae53e2d0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/Nukesor/pueue\u003e\n時間のかかるコマンドを裏で実行してくれるやつ。Rust製\n随分前にここに貼ったtask-spoolerと同系統の物らしい","ts":"1624876350.460000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"Nukesor/pueue","id":1,"title":"Nukesor/pueue","text":":stars: Manage your shell commands.","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"1960","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Rust","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"atQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d871cdfe-7e2d-481c-8a4a-09633fe07e6d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ありがとうございますー!","ts":"1624859931.459100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j4TX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22c99f85-7857-4896-ba4a-26a88a032395","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":":+1:しておきました","ts":"1624859896.458900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C=Rn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b35a9bf-f93b-4412-a153-26e6ec44f845","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/aws/aws-sam-cli/issues/2990\u003e\n生成しました。","ts":"1624859799.458500","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/aws/aws-sam-cli/issues/2990|#2990 sam deploy: Support `-` which indicates stdin\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/aws/aws-sam-cli/issues/2990|#2990 sam deploy: Support `-` which indicates stdin\u003e","text":"*Describe your idea/feature/enhancement*\n\nMany CLI commands can interpret `-` as a stdin/out. In `aws-cli`, `s3 cp` can use `-` as a stdin/out.\n\n```\n$ BUCKET=\u0026lt;your sample bucket\u0026gt;\n\n$ echo helloworld | aws s3 cp - s3://${BUCKET}/tmp\n\n$ aws s3 cp s3://${BUCKET}/tmp -\nhelloworld\n\n```\n\nIf `sam deploy` use stdin to pass template yaml, user can use any _pre process_ step for his template.\n\n```\n$ # local transform instead of Cloudformation macro\n$ cat template.yml | your-favorite-transformer | sam deploy --template-file -\n\n\n$ # mustache pre-process with SAM template\n$ cat template.yml.mustache | mustache data.json | sam deploy --template-file -\n\n\n$ # simple `sed` for SAM template (but the user should use *Parameters*.)\n$ cat template.yml | sed 's/__company/aws/g' | sam deploy --template-file -\n\n```\n\n*Proposal*\n\nAdd details of how to add this to the product.\n\n1. Add a special action step if the user specifies `-` for `--template-file` option.\n2. The special action is, get template string from stdin instead of reading local file.\n\nThings to consider:\n\n1. What happens when a user really wants to deal with a `-` file?\n    • Unix command `cat` address `-` file as a `./-`.  \n        So you can `cat ./-` if you want to see `-` file.\n2. Why can we assume that - implicitly indicates stdin/out? Any authoritative sources?\n    • See POSIX specification: \u003chttps://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/basedefs/V1_chap12.html#tag_12_02|https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/basedefs/V1_chap12.html#tag_12_02\u003e  \n        \"12.2 Utility Syntax Guidelines\", \"Guideline 13:\"\n        \n        \u0026gt; For utilities that use operands to represent files to be opened for either reading or writing, the '-' operand should be used to mean only standard input (or standard output when it is clear from context that an output file is being specified) or a file named -.\n\n*Additional Details*\n\nNone","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/aws/aws-sam-cli|aws/aws-sam-cli\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1624859778}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D50z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d295c997-a53a-4545-897a-cf357cd035d9","type":"message","user":"URNBMPJ4C","text":"ちょっと試してみたところ、BashPitfallsの罠はほぼshellcheckがカバーしてるっぽい。 \u003chttps://github.com/koalaman/shellcheck\u003e","ts":"1624856709.458000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"koalaman/shellcheck","id":1,"title":"koalaman/shellcheck","text":"ShellCheck, a static analysis tool for shell scripts","fields":[{"title":"Website","value":"\u003chttps://www.shellcheck.net\u003e","short":true},{"title":"Stars","value":"25194","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ThEU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"087dd711-3967-4be4-a5c3-2eea9a253810","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ちなみにこの記事の「罠」にリンクがありました。\n\u003chttps://qiita.com/ko1nksm/items/2f01ff4f50e957ebf1de#dsl-%E6%A7%8B%E6%96%87\u003e","ts":"1624854639.456300","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: ShellSpec - シェルスクリプト用のフル機能のBDDユニットテストフレームワーク - Qiita","id":1,"title":"ShellSpec - シェルスクリプト用のフル機能のBDDユニットテストフレームワーク - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/ko1nksm/items/2f01ff4f50e957ebf1de#dsl-%E6%A7%8B%E6%96%87","text":"ShellSpec はシェルスクリプト用に開発した BDD ユニットテストフレームワークです。初期版公開以降、多くの機能を追加しておりフル機能と言えるまでに成長したのですが公式サイトはほとんど更新しておらずその機能を伝えきれなくなって...","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn